    <title>061.戒断短视频3个月，离开被算法投喂的世界，我从未如此清醒。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6984fab470aae7e967cbe8cf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6984fab470aae7e967cbe8cf</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Feb 2026 16:42:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从去年十一月开始，我从互联网（口播世界）上“消失”了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>起因是一次意外的抖音封号，加上一份让我后背发凉的心理学研究报告。</span></p><span></span><p><span>很多人问：不刷短视频，怎么查攻略？怎么跟上潮流？会不会错过重要信息？这</span></p><span></span><p><span>期单口，我想聊聊这 90 天里我真实的“戒断”体验，以及我如何用 AI 和搜索引擎重构了我的信息获取方式。</span></p><span></span><p><span>事实证明，离开被算法投喂的世界，我从未如此清醒。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>主播小红书：</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/AD0i3d0TzGv" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/AD0i3d0TzGv"><span>Arya陈辰</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴 &amp; Highlight】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 被迫离场与主动选择</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 戒断不仅不痛苦，还很爽</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a> 当 AI 成为我的新“小红书”</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 创作者的反思：我们都在消耗注意力</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 关掉手机，世界依然转动</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【提及资料】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>研究报告：《</span><a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41231585/" data-url="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/41231585/"><span>Feeds, Feelings, and Focus: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis Examining the Cognitive and Mental Health Correlates of Short-Form Video Use</span></a><span>》中文翻译：信息流、情绪和专注力：一项系统性综述和荟萃分析，探讨短视频使用与认知和心理健康的相关性</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
